            "title": "Spot an oversized boundary",
            "id": 152127,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il gestore si aspetta solo il testo relativo ai posti non validi. Quale operazione dovrebbe essere spostata fuori da questo blocco <code>try</code> troppo grande?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"booking.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  seats = int(form[\" /><text value=\"&quot;seats&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  total = seats * form[\" /><text value=\"&quot;price&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  save_booking(total)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"None\" class=\"literal\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il calcolo del totale e la chiamata a <code>save_booking()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">La conversione con <code>int()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Il gestore di <code>ValueError</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">L'intero corpo della funzione</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il calcolo del totale e la chiamata a <code>save_booking()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Move recovery to the caller",
            "id": 152128,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La prenotazione ha una chiave <code>\"seats\"</code>, ma il relativo testo potrebbe non essere valido. Completa il gestore specifico del chiamante attorno a <code>parse_seats()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"booking.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"parse_seats\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(value)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" int(value)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"process_booking\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(booking)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    seats = parse_seats(booking[\" /><text value=\"&quot;seats&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"None\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" seats\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"133\" endIndex=\"143\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"KeyError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TypeError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>ValueError</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
